# HOL4 Proof Pipeline Skills

Three-phase proof development methodology:

## /hol4-plan
Interactive proof planning. Creates mathematical argument with validated assumptions.
See [plan.md](plan.md)

## /hol4-sketch
Translate plan to HOL4 sketch. Creates SML with cheats + task files for subagents.
See [sketch.md](sketch.md)

## /hol4-task-prep
Prepare task files for the proof agent. Freeze theorem statements, set dual acceptance criteria, write proof strategy.
See [task-prep.md](task-prep.md)

## /hol4-prove
Fill in cheats and complete proofs. Interactive or autonomous mode.
See [prove.md](prove.md)

## Methodology Prompts

- `planner.md` - Planning methodology (in this directory, used via `/hol4-plan`)
- `prompts/hol4/sketch_impl.md` - Sketching methodology
- `prompts/hol4/_proving.md` - Proving discipline
- `prompts/hol4/oracle.md` - Plan oracle methodology
- `prompts/hol4/orchestrator.md` - Orchestrator methodology

